# Evidence index (issue #1088, E110 — #1085 D7)
#
# The "public knowledge as cache" pattern VISION.md prescribes: the
# repository keeps the case-study prose and this index; the captured
# artifacts themselves live outside it, each entry carrying the sha256,
# size and URL that make the artifact re-fetchable and verifiable.
#
# Digests are content-addressed aggregates: sha256 over every
# (relative-path, file-sha256) pair under the group, so the digest changes
# if any file inside the group changes. Computed on the qa-reasoning-
# coding-bulk-fixes branch at e4193a615 plus the wave-3 commits; the move
# script below recomputes them at move time and rewrites this file.
#
# Destination layout (drafted; the repository is created by the move, the
# first artifact push publishes it):
#   https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai-evidence
#     dev/log/issues/<issue>/<capture>…          (5,426 files, 712.8 MB)
#     dev/log/self-authored/…                    (12 files)
#     docs/case-studies/<issue>/raw/…            (raw case-study logs)
#
# A row with url "pending-move" names an artifact group still inside this
# repository: scripts/move-evidence.rs fills the URL as it moves the group,
# and scripts/check-evidence-lines.rs fails a pull request that adds more
# than 2,000 non-source lines outside the three allowed prose paths, so
# the index is the only direction the volume may grow.
evidence_index
  source_repository "link-assistant/formal-ai"
  evidence_repository "link-assistant/formal-ai-evidence"
  digest_method "sha256 over sorted (relative path, file sha256) pairs per group"
  group
    path "dev/log/issues"
    files 5426
    bytes 712840462
    sha256 "a1b8741cfbcf004b"
    url "pending-move"
  group
    path "dev/log/self-authored"
    files 12
    bytes 108016
    sha256 "b6c46efd8b4c4533"
    url "pending-move"
